{"about_the_game":"<strong>+ PC Maker</strong> is a simulation game in which you have to assemble and customize computers, and also improve your home/office as you progress through the game.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138760/extras/459511b81161084b90f614f11a79ab53.avif?t=1768030019\" width=648 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, we have worked out a good system for assembling and customizing a PC, so you can make a PC assembly that is closest to what you would like to assemble in life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the PC build, you can install the operating system on it and test it in various benchmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The construction system is also well developed, thanks to which you can create amazingly detailed interiors.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3138760?t=1768030019","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138760/ce03564e5ff758490d375c377c985457244a5fd1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768030019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138760/9696d963c66b9ba4603fa4db90dd84e45ae8e0cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768030019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138760/9696d963c66b9ba4603fa4db90dd84e45ae8e0cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768030019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>+ PC Maker</strong> is a simulation game in which you have to assemble and customize computers, and also improve your home/office as you progress through the game.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138760/extras/459511b81161084b90f614f11a79ab53.avif?t=1768030019\" width=648 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, we have worked out a good system for assembling and customizing a PC, so you can make a PC assembly that is closest to what you would like to assemble in life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the PC build, you can install the operating system on it and test it in various benchmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The construction system is also well developed, thanks to which you can create amazingly detailed interiors.</p>","developers":["SpeedWaGoon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138760/95ce2847e6d8b81c41d8a6fabd0be2c65df3ed6b/header.jpg?t=1768030019","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3138760/837846411/22bd2b8c192119248b7c62ff9a3f963d91b81a32/1766301042/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766302237","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3138760/837846411/22bd2b8c192119248b7c62ff9a3f963d91b81a32/1766301042/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766302237","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3138760/837846411/22bd2b8c192119248b7c62ff9a3f963d91b81a32/1766301042/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766302237","id":257253396,"name":"Basic Gameplay Process","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257253396/ee9a038c560ed64808a756b51c60dc4064ac6f97/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766302237"}],"name":"+ PC Maker","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i7-6700 or Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</str